# cyto genome exported from cell 12 — load it via Load Genome (rename to cyto-brush.gene).
Break bc : Biomass < 2000 : Convert bc @15
Break bc : Biomass < 4000 & bc < ba & bc < 2000 : Convert ba @15
Light : ba < 10000 & bb < bc & bb < 2000 : FormBond b a
Light : bb < 10000 & bc < ba & bc < 2000 : FormBond b b
Light : bc < 10000 & ba < bb & ba < 2000 : FormBond b c
